---
title: "INT-01: Comunicación Asíncrona — core-api ↔ RabbitMQ ↔ checkout-service"
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Mobile as 📱 App Móvil
    participant CoreAPI as ⚙️ core-api :8080
    participant Exchange as 🐰 ecommerce.checkout.exchange
    participant QReq as 📥 checkout-requested.q
    participant CheckoutSvc as ⚙️ checkout-service :8082
    participant QComp as 📤 checkout-completed.q

    Note over Mobile,QComp: Flujo 1 — Inicio de Checkout

    Mobile->>CoreAPI: POST /api/v1/checkout {cartId} [Bearer JWT]
    activate CoreAPI
    CoreAPI->>CoreAPI: CheckoutUseCase: valida carrito, crea CheckoutRequest PENDING
    CoreAPI->>CoreAPI: Persiste en core_db
    CoreAPI->>Exchange: PUBLISH checkout.requested {eventId, requestId, items, totalAmount}
    CoreAPI-->>Mobile: 201 { requestId, status:PENDING, totalAmount }
    deactivate CoreAPI

    Note over Mobile,QComp: Flujo 2 — Procesamiento Asíncrono

    Exchange->>QReq: enruta por routing key
    QReq->>CheckoutSvc: entrega mensaje
    activate CheckoutSvc
    CheckoutSvc->>CheckoutSvc: Verifica idempotencia (InboxEvent)
    CheckoutSvc->>CheckoutSvc: Crea Order en checkout_db
    CheckoutSvc->>Exchange: PUBLISH checkout.accepted
    CheckoutSvc->>CheckoutSvc: StripeSimulatedPaymentAdapter (in-process ~500ms)
    CheckoutSvc->>Exchange: PUBLISH payment.processed {transactionId: stripe_sim_*, success:true}
    CheckoutSvc->>CheckoutSvc: Order.status = COMPLETED
    CheckoutSvc->>Exchange: PUBLISH checkout.completed {checkoutRequestId, orderId}
    CheckoutSvc->>CheckoutSvc: InboxEvent.processed = true
    deactivate CheckoutSvc

    Note over Mobile,QComp: Flujo 3 — Actualización en core-api

    Exchange->>QComp: enruta checkout.completed
    QComp->>CoreAPI: entrega mensaje
    activate CoreAPI
    CoreAPI->>CoreAPI: CheckoutRequest.status = COMPLETED en core_db
    deactivate CoreAPI

    Note over Mobile,QComp: Flujo 4 — Polling de estado

    Mobile->>CoreAPI: GET /api/v1/checkout/{requestId} [Bearer JWT]
    CoreAPI-->>Mobile: 200 { status:COMPLETED, totalAmount }
